    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the overhead stowage compartment shell, its tie rods, the trim kit and the curtain rail at one cabin bay, with the deeper and the delivered shell items.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "To identify the overhead stowage compartment shell, its tie rods, the trim kit and the curtain rail at a single cabin bay.",
      "figure_note": "The figure shows one bay at the left-hand side viewed from the aisle; the right-hand bay is a mirror image. Item 10 and item 10A are the deeper and the delivered partition assemblies, which are not interchangeable because the tie-rod positions differ. The bay load placard is not an illustrated item but belongs to the shell fitted, and the placard part must be ordered with the shell. The bin light assembly transfers from the old shell to the new one and is listed for reference only on sheet 2."
    },
